"""
CodeEfficiencyAnalyzer v20.0 – Added JavaScript Vuln Patches, AI Code Suggestions, Enhanced Transformer Accuracy
Improvements:
- Added JavaScript autofix: Uses tree-sitter-javascript for AST, patches XSS (replace innerHTML with textContent/escape), CSRF (add token stubs), Prototype Pollution (add Object.freeze), Insecure Deserialization (add validation), SQLi (suggest ORM/prepared), etc.
- Integrated AI code suggestions: Stub for LLM (uses simple heuristic/random suggestions; expand with real API like OpenAI if net avail, or local torch model)
- Enhanced transformer accuracy: Added validation post-transform (check AST integrity), more try-except, heuristics for node matching, config for precision vs. recall
- Robustness: Fixes chained with validation, logs per fix, configurable thresholds
"""

